        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG3001D, Stainless Steel Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel Dummy Door Handleset is for use on a pair of French Doors for the inactive door. Purchase in conjunction with the matching <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-mortise-lock-entry-handleset-ahi-sig3001\">Stainless Steel Mortise Lock Entry Handleset</a> for a full set that is as handsome as it is durable. The Stainless Steel Dummy Handleset is made out of 304 grade stainless steel for long-lasting toughness.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-mortise-lock-entry-handleset-ahi-sig3001\"><b>AHI SIG3001 Stainless Steel Entry Handelset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>All Stainless Steel Trim:</b> From <a href=\"/collections/ahi\"><b>AHI Hardware</b></a> the SIG3004D is made from 304 grade stainless steel, which is resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasion making it an ideal material for door hardware. It needs little looking after.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications: AHI SIG3001D Stainless Steel Dummy Handleset</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Solid Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 17-1/4\" (438 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3-1/4\" (83 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\" (280 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 3-1/4\" (83 mm)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SIG3001.pdf?v=1691093349\"><b>AHI SIG3001D Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. </i>\r\n</p>",
